.jpg","url":"https:\/\/www.salon.com\/2016\/03\/31\/the_washington_posts_revealing_blunder_their_screwup_over_the_fbis_hillary_probe_is_a_great_example_of_why_americans_hate_the_press\/","position":14},{"@type":"ListItem","name":"GOP's desperate Marco Rubio reboot: The #marcomentum narrative is just pathetic and will go nowhere","image":"https:\/\/www.salon.com\/app\/uploads\/2016\/02\/gop-2016-rubio.jpeg15-e1455731485704.jpg","url":"https:\/\/www.salon.com\/2016\/02\/17\/gops_desperate_marco_rubio_reboot_the_marcomentum_narrative_is_just_pathetic_and_will_go_nowhere\/","position":15},{"@type":"ListItem","name":"The media's Hillary Clinton problem: It's very simple -- the media is annoying","image":"https:\/\/www.salon.com\/app\/uploads\/2015\/05\/hillary_clinton15.jpg","url":"https:\/\/www.salon.com\/2015\/05\/20\/the_medias_hillary_clinton_problem_its_very_simple_the_media_is_annoying\/","position":16},{"@type":"ListItem","name":"Objectively bad: Ezra Klein, Nate Silver, Jonathan Chait and return of the \"view from nowhere\"","image":"https:\/\/www.salon.com\/app\/uploads\/2014\/04\/chait_silver_klein.jpg","url":"https:\/\/www.salon.com\/2014\/04\/12\/objectively_bad_ezra_klein_nate_silver_jonathan_chait_and_return_of_the_view_from_nowhere\/","position":17}]}}]}</script>

